<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Penal Code [Act 574], which is referred to as the “Code” in this Act, is amended by inserting after section 52 the following sections: ‘ “Non-serious offence” 52a. The words “non-serious offence” denote an offence punishable with imprisonment for a term of not more than ten years. “Serious offence” 52b. The words “serious offence” denote an offence punishable with imprisonment for a term of ten years or more.’. New section 75a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/eng@> .
