<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/eng@/~cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "The Code is amended in section 435 by substituting for the words “seven years” the words “fourteen years”. Amendment of section 436"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/eng@> .
